From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Garcia <lex@ibm.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 07:51:34 -0500
Subject: agent host: restore the claude agent without its copilot proxy

`ClaudeAgent` ships a `native` transport alongside the Copilot-CAPI proxy, so it is pinned to that and talks to Anthropic on the user's own credentials (`ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`, or `CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN` from `claude setup-token`). Models are enumerated from the SDK rather than CAPI, the required Copilot protected resource is dropped so no GitHub account is needed, and the OTel service the agent injected for session-title spans goes with the proxy since its node implementation is not built. `@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk` returns as a devDependency for typechecking and development runs; built products resolve it from `VSCODE_AGENT_HOST_CLAUDE_SDK_ROOT`.

